hotspot-share (2.0.10-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add deep health-check to GUI launcher to verify HTTP 200 frontend response.
  * Terminate any zombie backend process holding port 8080 across snap updates.
  * Bundle web frontend assets directly inside Python package directory (hotspot_share/web).
  * Expand fallback search to canonical /snap/hotspot-share/current paths.

